From: =?UTF-8?q?Ball=C3=B3=20Gy=C3=B6rgy?= <ballogyor@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 22:26:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Set prgname to application ID

Using the application ID ensures that Wayland compositors could match the
window with the application and show the appropriate icon for them.
---
 playitslowly/app.py | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/playitslowly/app.py b/playitslowly/app.py
index 32ad43b..f70d6f7 100755
--- a/playitslowly/app.py
+++ b/playitslowly/app.py
@@ -33,10 +33,11 @@
 import gi
 gi.require_version('Gst', '1.0')
 
-from gi.repository import Gtk, GObject, Gst, Gio, Gdk
+from gi.repository import Gtk, GObject, Gst, Gio, Gdk, GLib
 
 GObject.threads_init()
 Gst.init(None)
+GLib.set_prgname("playitslowly")
 
 from playitslowly.pipeline import Pipeline
 
